## next-desireds.soar -- thor-soar: 1 compare.
## v2.47: the next-desireds operator (proposal and application) moved to agent-world/next-desireds.soar
## (L9-024); only the Thor-specific preference stays here.

## Preference for next-desireds.
sp {thor-soar*compare*next-desireds
    :default
   (state <s> ^operator <op1> +
                        { <> <op1> <op2> }  +)
   (<op1> ^name next-desireds)
   (<op2> ^name create-object-state-desired)
-->
   (<s> ^operator <op1> > <op2>)
}
